      "publishedDate": "2026-11-27T14:17:15.949Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-11-27T14:17:15.949Z",
      "description": "Dell Secure Connect Gateway - Virtual Edition, versions prior to 5.36.00.16, contains an Improper Access Control vulnerability. A low privileged local attacker could potentially exploit this vulnerability, leading to Information disclosure.",
      "severity": 7.3,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：Dell Secure Connect Gateway - Virtual Edition\n🔓 漏洞类型：CWE-284 (CWE-284)\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
      "references": [
        {
          "url": "https://www.dell.com/support/kbdoc/en-cv/000534756/dsa-2026-507-security-update-for-dell-secure-connect-gateway-virtual-edition-multiple-vulnerabilities-version-2",
          "type": "reference"
        }
      ],
      "affected": [
